    {
      "id": "ed64157c-323f-5070-aa28-9c35efce2999",
      "name": "Note 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# URLs → summaries → Google Sheet\nPut your URLs in **URLs to scrape**. Each page is scraped to Markdown (10 credits/page), summarised by AI, and added as a row.\n\n## Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Install the **S.A Labs** node: Settings → Community nodes → `n8n-nodes-salabs`.\n2. Open each **S.A Labs** node → Credential → *Create new* → paste your API key from the S.A Labs dashboard.\n3. The AI step uses **Google Gemini** (free API key from aistudio.google.com). You can swap it for OpenAI, Claude or any other chat model.\n4. Make a Google Sheet with headers **URL, Title, Summary, Scraped at** and paste its link into **Add to Google Sheet**.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 340
      }
    }
  ],
